SurahIndex":"030","VerseNumber":38,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَـَٔاتِ ذَا ٱلۡقُرۡبَىٰ حَقَّهُۥ وَٱلۡمِسۡكِينَ وَٱبۡنَ ٱلسَّبِيلِۚ ذَٰلِكَ خَيۡرٞ لِّلَّذِينَ يُرِيدُونَ وَجۡهَ ٱللَّهِۖ وَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلۡمُفۡلِحُونَ","TajweedText":"فَـَٔـاتِ ذَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقُرْبَىٰ حَقَّهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمِسْكِينَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>نَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّبِيلِ‌ۚ ذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ خَيْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>رٌ ل</tajweed>ِّلَّذِينَ يُرِيدُونَ وَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>هَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ‌ۖ وَأُ<tajweed class=slnt>وْ</tajweed>لَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ئِكَ هُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُفْلِح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٨</span>","End":"٣٨","PageNumber":408,"JuzNumber":21,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":352,"MaqraNumber":163,"HizbNumber":41,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":30,"SurahIndex":"030","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَآ ءَاتَيۡتُم مِّن رِّبٗا لِّيَرۡبُوَاْ فِيٓ أَمۡوَٰلِ ٱلنَّاسِ فَلَا يَرۡبُواْ عِندَ ٱللَّهِۖ وَمَآ ءَاتَيۡتُم مِّن زَكَوٰةٖ تُرِيدُونَ وَجۡهَ ٱللَّهِ فَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلۡمُضۡعِفُونَ","TajweedText":"وَم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> ءَاتَيْت<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ر</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>بًا ل</tajweed>ِّيَرْبُوَ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> ف<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَمْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسِ فَلَا يَرْبُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> عِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ند</tajweed>َ <tajwe